WEBVTT

00:01.500 --> 00:05.510
<b>Yes... Take it to the
Benerit Group's head office front.</b>

00:06.560 --> 00:09.660
<b>I have an idea for a pilot.</b>

00:31.820 --> 00:33.440
<b>How many days has it been?</b>

00:33.440 --> 00:35.270
<b>I could use a shower.</b>

00:35.270 --> 00:38.350
<b>How long are they going to keep us here?</b>

00:38.350 --> 00:40.470
<b>Until they let us relocate...</b>

00:40.470 --> 00:43.150
<b>It's not like we did anything wrong...</b>

00:43.150 --> 00:45.030
<b>I'm so sick of this.</b>

00:45.420 --> 00:47.520
<b>Does everyone have enough blankets?</b>

00:48.010 --> 00:50.110
<b>If you need one, speak up!</b>

00:50.510 --> 00:51.760
<b>I'll take one.</b>

00:51.760 --> 00:52.280
<b>Sure!</b>

00:53.740 --> 00:56.910
<b>Why are you doing all this, huh?</b>

00:57.930 --> 00:59.680
<b>Because I can move around!</b>

01:00.490 --> 01:02.380
<b>Hey! Could we have some, too?</b>

01:02.380 --> 01:03.630
<b>Oh, right!</b>

01:04.640 --> 01:06.170
<b>Mercurian Miss...</b>

01:06.820 --> 01:08.580
<b>Have you changed?</b>

01:10.570 --> 01:11.300
<b>I guess so.</b>

02:43.990 --> 02:46.020
<b>Episode 21</b>

02:47.580 --> 02:48.720
<b><i>How's Petra?</i></b>

02:48.720 --> 02:51.400
<b>They say she's still at risk.</b>

02:51.400 --> 02:53.610
<b>They're going to save her, aren't they?</b>

02:53.610 --> 02:55.110
<b>She'll be okay, right?</b>

02:55.590 --> 02:59.290
<b><i>I can't get hold of Mr. Lauda, either.</i></b>

02:59.800 --> 03:01.710
<b>I'll try contacting him myself.</b>

03:01.710 --> 03:03.370
<b>You guys get some rest.</b>

03:06.230 --> 03:07.040
<b>Damn it...</b>

03:08.660 --> 03:10.740
<b>This is an analysis of that machine...</b>

03:11.210 --> 03:14.760
<b>There's no doubt
it's the same Gundam as before.</b>

03:14.760 --> 03:18.600
<b>I couldn't find anything that would
let us identify the pilot.</b>

03:18.950 --> 03:22.010
<b>That we didn't notice
Shaddiq Zenelli was harboring them...</b>

03:22.010 --> 03:24.100
<b>was a failure on our part.</b>

03:24.100 --> 03:27.600
<b>I guess the Space Assembly League
will make its move now.</b>

03:26.770 --> 03:30.320
<b><i>Having learned that
Miorine Rembran has been chosen to be ...</i></b>

03:30.320 --> 03:31.690
<b>At a time like this...</b>

03:30.320 --> 03:32.770
<b><i>next president of the Benerit Group...</i></b>

03:33.260 --> 03:35.480
<b>Where's Miorine? Is she back?</b>

03:35.480 --> 03:36.660
<b>Yes.</b>

03:36.660 --> 03:39.030
<b>But she has yet to...</b>

03:50.350 --> 03:52.320
<b>I heard what happened at Quinharbor.</b>

03:54.230 --> 03:56.500
<b>Where did I go wrong?</b>

03:56.990 --> 03:58.870
<b>The town was destroyed...</b>

03:59.590 --> 04:04.430
<b>and so many people...</b>

04:02.240 --> 04:04.430
<b>Don't shoulder everything yourself.
It's not your fau--</b>

04:04.430 --> 04:05.720
<b>It was me.</b>

04:05.720 --> 04:07.860
<b>The people on Earth...</b>

04:08.350 --> 04:09.770
<b>and the school...</b>

04:10.250 --> 04:11.290
<b>it's all...</b>

04:12.990 --> 04:15.860
<b>Right now, Rajan is speaking
to the board members.</b>

04:15.860 --> 04:18.390
<b>We have to set
the Group's direction.</b>

04:19.130 --> 04:20.280
<b>Also...</b>

04:20.940 --> 04:22.730
<b>We have Shaddiq in custody.</b>

04:24.350 --> 04:26.160
<b>I hear you're going to be president.</b>

04:26.160 --> 04:27.680
<b>My condolences.</b>

04:28.640 --> 04:31.000
<b>Is that all you have to say?</b>

04:31.000 --> 04:32.840
<b>How are Sabina and the others?</b>

04:32.840 --> 04:35.040
<b>They're all unhurt.</b>

04:37.040 --> 04:39.380
<b>It was all my plan.</b>

04:39.780 --> 04:42.060
<b>I'd like you to go easy on them.</b>

04:42.820 --> 04:44.890
<b>It was too dazzling.</b>

04:44.890 --> 04:49.530
<b>Your ideal of putting Earth
and space on equal terms.</b>

04:50.250 --> 04:52.140
<b>That's why you did it the wrong way.</b>

04:53.170 --> 04:55.490
<b>Still, someone has to do it.</b>

04:55.490 --> 04:59.520
<b>Even if it's just so there won't be
more people like us.</b>

05:00.050 --> 05:02.700
<b>When did you involve
the Assembly League?</b>

05:02.700 --> 05:04.700
<b>I made contact long ago.</b>

05:05.150 --> 05:08.090
<b>But I suppose
I decided to cross the line when...</b>

05:10.270 --> 05:11.490
<b>What a fool.</b>

05:12.190 --> 05:15.590
<b>Do you think I'm despicable
for using even cowardly means?</b>

05:16.400 --> 05:17.290
<b>No.</b>

05:18.020 --> 05:20.300
<b>I'm just as guilty.</b>

05:22.800 --> 05:26.640
<b>I can't eat this stuff anymore.
Isn't there anything better?</b>

05:26.640 --> 05:28.480
<b>Not likely, in this state.</b>

05:28.480 --> 05:31.360
<b>I want something different!</b>

05:31.360 --> 05:32.350
<b>Here you are!</b>

05:32.350 --> 05:32.970
<b>Huh?</b>

05:33.350 --> 05:34.250
<b>What are these?</b>

05:34.250 --> 05:35.220
<b>They're tomatoes!</b>

05:35.220 --> 05:37.150
<b>I can tell that by looking at them, but...</b>

05:37.150 --> 05:39.190
<b>Please, just take a bite.</b>

05:39.190 --> 05:40.550
<b>Bite in!</b>

05:45.090 --> 05:46.910
<b>Y-Yummy...</b>

05:46.910 --> 05:48.470
<b>Huh? Seriously?</b>

05:49.740 --> 05:50.800
<b>It's good!</b>

05:50.800 --> 05:51.500
<b>Right?</b>

05:51.500 --> 05:52.280
<b>Yeah!</b>

05:52.280 --> 05:56.540
<b>I should've listened to my mom...
and gone home sooner.</b>

05:56.540 --> 05:58.250
<b>Here.</b>

05:58.770 --> 05:59.710
<b>Thanks.</b>

06:00.340 --> 06:01.590
<b>Don't thank me...</b>

06:02.030 --> 06:03.600
<b>Thank Suletta.</b>

06:05.030 --> 06:06.500
<b>Hey, Suletta...</b>

06:06.500 --> 06:07.050
<b>Yes?</b>

06:07.050 --> 06:09.640
<b>Wasn't the greenhouse crushed too?</b>

06:10.120 --> 06:11.600
<b>Well, the truth is...</b>

06:13.510 --> 06:16.820
<b>I was refrigerating
the ones we hadn't eaten.</b>

06:16.820 --> 06:18.320
<b>Whoa! This is awesome!</b>

06:18.320 --> 06:20.020
<b>That's quite a lot.</b>

06:20.020 --> 06:21.780
<b>What should we do with them?</b>

06:21.780 --> 06:25.190
<b>Since the power is still unstable,
maybe we should hand them all out.</b>

06:25.190 --> 06:27.200
<b>Sounds good. Let's do it.</b>

06:27.200 --> 06:28.860
<b>Don't you have to ask Miorine?</b>

06:29.350 --> 06:34.210
<b>I'm sure Ms. Miorine would say,
"Just hurry up and do it."</b>

06:34.210 --> 06:36.180
<b>Yeah, sounds like her.</b>

06:39.230 --> 06:41.380
<b>Thank goodness we had all these carts!</b>

06:41.380 --> 06:43.290
<b>We'll carry everything to the tents!</b>

06:43.640 --> 06:45.970
<b>Let's go back and get ready
to hand things out.</b>

06:45.970 --> 06:47.040
<b>I'll help!</b>

06:49.500 --> 06:49.930
<b>Nika!</b>

06:53.530 --> 06:57.930
<b>I've been thinking...
we need to talk one more time.</b>

06:58.290 --> 06:59.440
<b>Um...</b>

07:00.210 --> 07:01.190
<b>I...</b>

07:01.190 --> 07:03.900
<b>Once the recovery work
is done, I'm dropping out.</b>

07:04.840 --> 07:07.990
<b>Oh, but that doesn't mean
I've given up on school.</b>

07:07.990 --> 07:10.320
<b>First I have to turn myself in
and make amends...</b>

07:10.730 --> 07:14.080
<b>then I can return to school
in my own right.</b>

07:14.630 --> 07:19.200
<b>I still don't want to give up on the dream
of bridging Earth and space.</b>

07:24.130 --> 07:25.240
<b>I'm so sorry.</b>

07:26.140 --> 07:29.420
<b>It's not like I wanted
to punish you, but...</b>

07:30.160 --> 07:32.050
<b>What was I supposed to do?</b>

07:32.710 --> 07:35.120
<b>If I'd been alone, I'd have given up.</b>

07:37.030 --> 07:39.560
<b>But since I met you all...</b>

07:39.820 --> 07:42.310
<b>Because you opened my eyes, Martin...</b>

07:42.310 --> 07:44.400
<b>I can keep trying.</b>

07:46.210 --> 07:49.280
<b>If you're ever in trouble,
you can always tell me.</b>

07:50.080 --> 07:52.070
<b>I'm the head of the House!</b>

07:53.030 --> 07:54.160
<b>Thank you.</b>

07:55.710 --> 07:56.450
<b>Have some!</b>

07:56.800 --> 07:58.380
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

07:58.380 --> 08:01.500
<b>LP041, Suletta Mercury...</b>

08:01.500 --> 08:03.720
<b>I guess that's about everyone.</b>

08:03.720 --> 08:05.220
<b>Right...</b>

08:05.220 --> 08:06.450
<b>Suletta!</b>

08:07.690 --> 08:10.340
<b>Ms. Belmeria and...</b>

08:10.860 --> 08:13.310
<b>Are you Prospera Mercury's daughter?</b>

08:13.310 --> 08:14.130
<b>Yes.</b>

08:14.130 --> 08:18.060
<b>I'm Guston Parche, an inspector
of the Space Assembly League.</b>

08:18.060 --> 08:19.890
<b>Assembly... League?</b>

08:19.890 --> 08:24.080
<b>An administrative body that mediates
political problems among the fronts.</b>

08:24.080 --> 08:27.050
<b>What does a bureaucrat like you
want with us?</b>

08:27.050 --> 08:29.440
<b>There's something we'd like to ask of you.</b>

08:35.720 --> 08:40.330
<b>The combat actions at the school front
that endangered civilian students...</b>

08:36.430 --> 08:40.330
<b>The Space Assembly League Front</b>

08:40.330 --> 08:42.880
<b>The abduction of Grassley's CEO...</b>

08:42.880 --> 08:46.290
<b>These were all crimes committed
within the Group.</b>

08:46.290 --> 08:52.340
<b>And the armed suppression of
anti-Spacian demonstrations on Earth</b>

08:52.340 --> 08:54.720
<b>has resulted in many casualties.</b>

08:55.020 --> 08:58.650
<b>Furthermore, we've confirmed
they were secretly developing Quiet Zero,</b>

08:58.650 --> 09:01.100
<b>a weapon of mass destruction.</b>

09:01.360 --> 09:03.690
<b>At present,
the Benerit Group can only be called</b>

09:03.690 --> 09:06.840
<b>a threat to peace among the fronts.</b>

09:07.310 --> 09:11.910
<b>The courageous whistleblowing
of Peil Technologies is to be commended.</b>

09:11.910 --> 09:16.820
<b>For the peace and tranquility of
the fronts, the Space Assembly League</b>

09:16.820 --> 09:20.420
<b>hereby proposes a forcible intervention</b>

09:20.420 --> 09:25.300
<b>against the Benerit Group for the
purpose of dissolving the conglomerate.</b>

09:30.610 --> 09:32.960
<b>By the unanimous consent
of all members,</b>

09:32.960 --> 09:36.470
<b>and under the authority of
Article 7 of the League Charter,</b>

09:37.120 --> 09:39.970
<b>the forcible intervention
against the Benerit Group...</b>

09:40.790 --> 09:42.690
<b>is hereby approved.</b>

09:44.470 --> 09:46.040
<b><i>According to their joint statement,</i></b>

09:46.040 --> 09:48.980
<b><i>the League will act to resolve
the unrest within the Benerit Group...</i></b>

09:49.730 --> 09:52.730
<b>Peil chose now to jump ship...</b>

09:52.730 --> 09:55.590
<b>Haven't you been able to
track down Prospera Mercury yet?</b>

09:55.590 --> 09:58.050
<b>We searched Shin Sei's terminals,</b>

09:58.050 --> 10:02.140
<b>but all data about Quiet Zero
had already been erased.</b>

10:02.140 --> 10:05.330
<b>What about the Mobile Suit
Development Council and Cathedra?</b>

10:05.330 --> 10:07.970
<b>They've decided to second
the Assembly League.</b>

10:12.220 --> 10:14.800
<b>It's from President Sarius.</b>

10:15.420 --> 10:18.650
<b>I'm glad to see you're well, Mr. President.</b>

10:18.650 --> 10:20.490
<b><i>Never mind the pleasantries.</i></b>

10:20.490 --> 10:23.010
<b><i>This is about the Assembly League.</i></b>

10:23.470 --> 10:25.910
<b>The situation is frustrating.</b>

10:25.910 --> 10:28.750
<b>Cathedra can no longer hold them back...</b>

10:29.970 --> 10:34.320
<b><i>You should have learned
more from Delling.</i></b>

10:35.440 --> 10:37.920
<b><i>You must cut off me and Grassley.</i></b>

10:38.770 --> 10:39.590
<b>Huh?</b>

10:39.590 --> 10:44.760
<b><i>Pin all the responsibility on us
and minimize the damage.</i></b>

10:44.760 --> 10:46.410
<b>But that means...</b>

10:46.410 --> 10:50.040
<b><i>You must think of the Group's
continued existence first...</i></b>

10:50.040 --> 10:52.190
<b><i>Miorine Rembran.</i></b>

10:56.740 --> 10:57.890
<b>I can't do that.</b>

10:58.460 --> 11:00.550
<b>I never want to sacrifice...</b>

11:01.340 --> 11:04.410
<b>anyone else.</b>

11:05.630 --> 11:07.600
<b>Quiet Zero?</b>

11:07.600 --> 11:11.660
<b>It's a system that establishes and extends</b>

11:11.660 --> 11:15.940
<b>a data storm network deployed by Aerial
and mobile suit-type GUND-Bits.</b>

11:15.940 --> 11:20.700
<b>All systems that use Permet
will be under its influence.</b>

11:20.700 --> 11:22.420
<b>Data storm...?</b>

11:22.420 --> 11:25.010
<b>Is there anything that
<i>doesn't</i> use Permet?!</b>

11:25.010 --> 11:28.100
<b>No. At least not in the fronts.</b>

11:28.100 --> 11:31.790
<b>But doesn't that mean this whatsit
will take over everything?!</b>

11:31.790 --> 11:35.060
<b>Prospera Mercury plans to use Quiet Zero</b>

11:35.060 --> 11:39.300
<b>to create a gigantic data storm network
within the Earth Sphere.</b>

11:39.300 --> 11:42.380
<b>If control of the fronts is lost,</b>

11:42.380 --> 11:45.780
<b>at worst, there could be
massive loss of life.</b>

11:46.680 --> 11:50.230
<b>We must stop her before Benerit
and the League come into conflict.</b>

11:50.680 --> 11:52.870
<b>I ask for your cooperation, too.</b>

11:55.390 --> 11:57.790
<b>Reasoning with Mom...</b>

11:58.390 --> 12:01.530
<b>is probably impossible.</b>

12:01.530 --> 12:04.340
<b>That can't be true.
Surely you, her daughter...</b>

12:05.400 --> 12:08.790
<b>I'm not her real daughter.</b>

12:08.790 --> 12:09.910
<b>Huh?</b>

12:09.910 --> 12:12.170
<b>Wait, wh-what are you...</b>

12:12.170 --> 12:13.560
<b>You're adopted?</b>

12:13.560 --> 12:17.590
<b>Oh, uh... well,
we're genetically related, but...</b>

12:17.590 --> 12:19.230
<b>Suletta--</b>

12:19.230 --> 12:20.650
<b>It's fine.</b>

12:20.650 --> 12:22.710
<b>I want everyone to hear.</b>

12:23.290 --> 12:25.840
<b>About my mom, me, and...</b>

12:26.460 --> 12:27.920
<b>about Aerial.</b>

12:32.050 --> 12:35.690
<b>To my mom, there's only one
real daughter... that's Aerial.</b>

12:36.470 --> 12:38.060
<b>Or rather, Ericht.</b>

12:39.350 --> 12:42.940
<b>Oh, and Ericht is...
sort of my big sister, or...</b>

12:43.730 --> 12:47.090
<b>I guess I'm what they call a repli-child,</b>

12:47.090 --> 12:50.370
<b>made from Ericht's genes.</b>

12:51.150 --> 12:55.560
<b>Long ago, Mom was researching
GUND technology.</b>

12:55.910 --> 12:59.730
<b>But when the Vanadis Incident
happened 21 years ago...</b>

12:59.730 --> 13:02.960
<b>she fled to Mercury with Ericht.</b>

13:02.960 --> 13:06.220
<b>Ericht's body was weakened,
and she was about to die.</b>

13:06.880 --> 13:10.600
<b>That's when Mom used GUND technology</b>

13:10.600 --> 13:14.480
<b>to transfer Ericht's
biometric code to Aerial.</b>

13:15.120 --> 13:19.470
<b>That means Aerial is now... Ericht's body.</b>

13:20.390 --> 13:25.670
<b>But it seems Ericht can only live
inside this data storm thing.</b>

13:26.110 --> 13:30.780
<b>So Mom's trying to create a place
where she can live freely.</b>

13:31.240 --> 13:35.870
<b>They said I was just a key
to get to that point.</b>

13:36.440 --> 13:39.890
<b>I loved my mom dearly.</b>

13:40.400 --> 13:42.170
<b>I still do.</b>

13:42.800 --> 13:45.420
<b>Thanks to Mom, I was able to go to school</b>

13:45.880 --> 13:47.380
<b>and meet all of you.</b>

13:48.470 --> 13:52.320
<b>But what's most precious to Mom...</b>

13:52.320 --> 13:53.680
<b>is Ericht.</b>

13:54.340 --> 13:58.700
<b>No matter what I say,
I don't think she'll listen.</b>

13:59.680 --> 14:02.960
<b>I'm sorry I can't be of more use.</b>

14:07.730 --> 14:11.120
<b>If there's another option
than reasoning with her...</b>

14:11.120 --> 14:12.260
<b>Huh?</b>

14:12.260 --> 14:16.760
<b>There's a machine the Assembly League
confiscated during the Vanadis Incident.</b>

14:17.760 --> 14:21.730
<b>It's a Gundam
they nicknamed a "monster"...</b>

14:22.710 --> 14:26.550
<b>We'd like you to pilot that Gundam.</b>

14:26.550 --> 14:27.900
<b>Hold it!</b>

14:27.900 --> 14:29.150
<b>You mean the Calibarn?</b>

14:29.150 --> 14:33.140
<b>That machine has no filter
against data storms!</b>

14:33.140 --> 14:35.090
<b>When she operates it, she'll...</b>

14:35.090 --> 14:39.120
<b>If persuasion's out of the question,
it's our only option.</b>

14:41.310 --> 14:44.150
<b>Would you just back off, Ms. Belmeria?</b>

14:44.150 --> 14:45.590
<b>Nika?</b>

14:45.590 --> 14:51.280
<b>At Peil, how many pilots did you
sacrifice in your Gundam experiments?!</b>

14:51.740 --> 14:53.550
<b>Like Elan Ceres...</b>

14:54.840 --> 14:57.140
<b>Now you're making Suletta expendable?</b>

14:57.140 --> 14:59.110
<b>No. That's not what I--</b>

14:59.110 --> 15:00.830
<b>Then why?</b>

15:00.830 --> 15:02.330
<b>I don't know.</b>

15:03.010 --> 15:03.900
<b>Huh?</b>

15:03.900 --> 15:05.890
<b>Shameful, isn't it?</b>

15:05.890 --> 15:07.920
<b>For an adult my age...</b>

15:08.870 --> 15:11.090
<b>On that day, 21 years ago...</b>

15:11.880 --> 15:14.760
<b>If only I'd died with the others...</b>

15:14.760 --> 15:16.970
<b>I've had that thought again and again...</b>

15:18.550 --> 15:19.990
<b>But still, I...</b>

15:23.180 --> 15:24.730
<b>Forgive me.</b>

15:26.100 --> 15:28.510
<b>I'm so sorry!</b>

15:29.440 --> 15:31.340
<b>You're too selfish.</b>

15:31.340 --> 15:33.370
<b>Suletta, you can't pilot that thing!</b>

15:34.400 --> 15:37.540
<b>Why didn't I realize until now?</b>

15:37.540 --> 15:38.850
<b>Huh?</b>

15:38.850 --> 15:42.020
<b>I've never been under
the Gundam's curse...</b>

15:42.020 --> 15:44.840
<b>because Ericht was taking it on herself.</b>

15:45.330 --> 15:46.540
<b>It must be...</b>

15:47.210 --> 15:51.840
<b>Only Ericht... was able to
fully synchronize with the data storm.</b>

15:52.430 --> 15:55.780
<b>That's why you were never affected.</b>

15:59.600 --> 16:00.550
<b>I...</b>

16:01.760 --> 16:03.810
<b>want to talk to Ericht.</b>

16:04.310 --> 16:06.230
<b>And with my mom, one more time.</b>

16:06.230 --> 16:07.320
<b>Suletta!</b>

16:07.320 --> 16:08.380
<b>Wait a minute!</b>

16:08.380 --> 16:11.050
<b>Do you really have to do it?</b>

16:11.050 --> 16:12.900
<b>You might die!</b>

16:12.900 --> 16:15.720
<b>Ms. Ericht won't protect you this time!</b>

16:15.720 --> 16:17.870
<b>When I was handing out the tomatoes...</b>

16:18.360 --> 16:19.850
<b>I realized something.</b>

16:20.200 --> 16:22.210
<b>Even if I don't gain anything,</b>

16:22.660 --> 16:25.100
<b>I have to do what I can.</b>

16:27.330 --> 16:28.800
<b>Take me there.</b>

16:29.580 --> 16:31.120
<b>To the Gundam.</b>

16:58.070 --> 17:01.750
<b>Aerial and Quiet Zero
have established interconnection.</b>

17:02.200 --> 17:04.770
<b>Are you ready, Madam President?</b>

17:04.770 --> 17:05.710
<b>Yes.</b>

17:06.630 --> 17:07.760
<b>Let's go.</b>

17:08.380 --> 17:11.710
<b><i>Attention all ships! Go to Level 4 alert!</i></b>

17:11.710 --> 17:14.480
<b>We're entering the fleet's
combined search area.</b>

17:15.840 --> 17:20.470
<b>Permet ID codes detected
near Lagrange 2 satellite cloud!</b>

17:20.470 --> 17:22.330
<b>Are they Benerit vessels?</b>

17:22.330 --> 17:23.600
<b>No...</b>

17:23.600 --> 17:25.720
<b>Something bigger than that.</b>

17:31.980 --> 17:34.070
<b>Don't tell me... that's...</b>

17:34.690 --> 17:36.480
<b>Quiet Zero?!</b>

17:37.070 --> 17:38.550
<b>What do we do?</b>

17:38.550 --> 17:40.590
<b>We'll capture it, as planned.</b>

17:40.590 --> 17:43.450
<b>It'll be good evidence
for our accusation of Benerit.</b>

17:44.280 --> 17:47.290
<b><i>Fleet-scale Permet ID codes detected.</i></b>

17:47.290 --> 17:50.040
<b><i>All belong to the Assembly League fleet.</i></b>

17:50.500 --> 17:51.710
<b>Eri...</b>

17:52.410 --> 17:53.470
<b><i>Please.</i></b>

18:11.350 --> 18:13.440
<b><i>Objects from Quiet Zero!</i></b>

18:13.440 --> 18:14.790
<b>They appear to be mobile suits.</b>

18:14.790 --> 18:15.650
<b>Cargores...</b>

18:16.150 --> 18:17.210
<b>Launch.</b>

18:39.130 --> 18:41.030
<b>Are these things unmanned?</b>

18:46.270 --> 18:48.540
<b><i>Assume anti-drone formation!</i></b>

18:48.540 --> 18:50.310
<b><i>No use! They're too maneuv--</i></b>

18:52.390 --> 18:55.320
<b>Quiet Zero receiving
multi-layer calls from all elements.</b>

18:55.320 --> 18:57.800
<b><i>Beginning creation of data storm space.</i></b>

19:16.380 --> 19:18.150
<b>We've lost control of our Permet links!</b>

19:18.150 --> 19:20.250
<b>The fleet command system is inoperable!</b>

19:20.250 --> 19:21.700
<b>We've been overridden.</b>

19:21.700 --> 19:22.550
<b>What?</b>

19:23.010 --> 19:25.050
<b>Come on! Move, damn it!</b>

19:25.050 --> 19:26.640
<b>Move!</b>

19:46.080 --> 19:49.500
<b>You damned witches!</b>

19:52.240 --> 19:57.900
<b><i>Override of all Assembly League vessel
and mobile suit systems complete.</i></b>

19:59.170 --> 20:00.730
<b>Well done.</b>

20:01.170 --> 20:02.630
<b>Thank you, Eri.</b>

20:04.860 --> 20:07.140
<b>It's finally begun.</b>

20:07.630 --> 20:10.090
<b>The world I'm creating for you!</b>

20:14.680 --> 20:16.940
<b>The Assembly League fleet...</b>

20:16.940 --> 20:18.690
<b>that easily...</b>

20:19.590 --> 20:22.420
<b>Announce a state of emergency
to all of Lagrange 4.</b>

20:22.420 --> 20:25.820
<b>Evacuate from this sector...</b>

20:22.420 --> 20:25.820
<b>Not again... More lives...</b>

20:25.820 --> 20:27.220
<b>We'll arrange it at once!</b>

20:27.220 --> 20:28.580
<b>I...</b>

20:28.580 --> 20:30.750
<b>The entire fleet was destroyed?</b>

20:30.750 --> 20:32.470
<b>What? No way!</b>

20:32.470 --> 20:36.380
<b>Is this Quiet Zero thing that crazy?</b>

20:37.120 --> 20:40.020
<b>At least we've pinpointed their location.</b>

20:40.020 --> 20:41.780
<b>We'll approach via
the head office front--</b>

20:41.780 --> 20:43.380
<b>Hold it, old man!</b>

20:43.380 --> 20:45.280
<b>Take us with you, too.</b>

20:45.280 --> 20:47.700
<b>You can let us leave this front,
can't you?</b>

20:47.700 --> 20:49.060
<b>"Old man..."?</b>

20:49.060 --> 20:51.200
<b>Ms. Chuchu, a minute ago, you...</b>

20:51.200 --> 20:53.060
<b>Of course, I'm still opposed to it!</b>

20:53.060 --> 20:57.120
<b>But that's why we can't
let you go alone, Suletta.</b>

20:57.430 --> 20:58.240
<b>I...</b>

20:58.240 --> 20:58.610
<b>Huh?</b>

20:59.060 --> 21:00.500
<b>...will never again...</b>

21:00.500 --> 21:02.650
<b>abandon one of my housemates!</b>

21:04.060 --> 21:05.990
<b>How nice.</b>

21:06.480 --> 21:08.370
<b>Take me with you, too.</b>

21:08.370 --> 21:10.430
<b>Mr... Elan...?</b>

21:10.430 --> 21:12.850
<b>Why... are you here?</b>

21:12.850 --> 21:17.210
<b>With security this tight,
there's no way I could escape alone.</b>

21:18.580 --> 21:20.480
<b>There's somewhere I want to go.</b>

21:20.480 --> 21:23.610
<b>If you'll let me walk away,
I'll lend you a hand.</b>

21:23.610 --> 21:26.330
<b>Though I refuse to pilot a Gundam.</b>

21:27.130 --> 21:28.780
<b>Has he changed personalities again?</b>

21:28.780 --> 21:29.890
<b>Yeah!</b>

21:29.890 --> 21:32.410
<b>I'm sorry for messing with you
all those times.</b>

21:32.410 --> 21:33.850
<b>My apologies.</b>

21:34.800 --> 21:39.270
<b>Will you tell me about
the Mr. Elan I knew?</b>

21:40.520 --> 21:42.860
<b>As much as I know myself.</b>

21:43.310 --> 21:44.850
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

21:46.230 --> 21:50.430
<b>I really hate... being an adult.</b>

21:58.700 --> 22:00.390
<b>It's her fault.</b>

22:01.330 --> 22:03.250
<b>Petra... the school...</b>

22:03.920 --> 22:06.150
<b>and how my brother changed...</b>

22:09.320 --> 22:10.720
<b>Miorine!</b>

23:44.130 --> 23:44.950
<b><i>Next time,</i></b>

23:44.670 --> 23:49.030
<b>Episode 22</b>

23:45.610 --> 23:47.310
<b><i>"The Woven Path."</i></b>

23:49.030 --> 23:52.250
<b>Illustration: LAM</b>
